","PDF workflow utilities","image optimization","AI-assisted productivity","ecommerce operations tools","technical writing for practical workflows"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"luowj1998@outlook.com","contactType":"customer support","availableLanguage":["English","Chinese"]},"publishingPrinciples":"https://toolorbit.site/about"}},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/timestamp-converter","name":"Unix Timestamp Converter: Online Epoch Date Tool","description":"Convert Unix timestamps (seconds & milliseconds) to human-readable dates and vice versa. Support for real-time live clock, time zones, and common formatting tasks for developers and database administrators."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/base-converter","name":"Universal Base Converter: Binary, Octal, Hex & Custom Bases","description":"Convert any number between bases 2 and 36 instantly. Our high-precision engine supports large integers (BigInt) and negative values, making it ideal for programmers and CS students."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/calculate/unit-converter","name":"Universal Web Unit Converter: Accurate Conversions for Every Scenario","description":"Whether you are a construction engineer used to using imperial units for overseas drawings, or a foodie baking according to foreign recipes, quickly breaking the barriers of weights and measures units formed by regional and historical factors is very valuable. This built-in toolbox provides high-precision constant comparison conversion services."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/calculate/time-converter","name":"Online Timezone Comparison Tool: Break Global Collaboration Barriers","description":"In global offices, cross-border gaming, or project synergy, converting between LA, London, or Beijing time can be frustrating. Policies like Daylight Saving Time (DST) make simple mental calculations unreliable. This calibrated tool eliminates scheduling headaches."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/calculate/archive-converter","name":"Online Archive Processor: Unpack & ZIP without Software","description":"Avoid bulky 3rd-party managers. Unpack ZIPs or create new archives directly in your browser. Fast, clean, and no disk waste."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/calculate/rmb-converter","name":"RMB Capital Converter: Standard Chinese Financial Formatting","description":"Prevent contract tampering. Formally convert monetary amounts to traditional Chinese characters (like 壹, 贰) used in banking and legal documents."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/calculate/ppi-calculator","name":"Online PPI Calculator: Unmask the Truth About Screen Sharpness","description":"When buying smartphones or monitors, ads talk about '4K' and 'Ultra-wide'. But resolution alone doesn't determine sharpness. PPI (Pixels Per Inch) is the gold standard for evaluating image quality."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":8,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/color-converter","name":"Professional Color Code Converter: HEX, RGB, HSL, CMYK","description":"Convert any color value between HEX, RGB, HSL, HSV, and CMYK formats. Features real-time preview and transparency support (RGBA/HEX8). Perfect for designers and developers."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":9,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/color-palette","name":"Color Palette","description":"Generate Tints and Shades from a primary color."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":10,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/color-picker","name":"Screen Color Picker: Capture Exact HEX Values Anywhere","description":"Pick any visible screen color with the browser EyeDropper API, copy HEX/RGB values, and sample UI, images, apps, or design references without uploads."},{"@type":"ListItem","position":11,"url":"https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/hex-string-converter","name":"Hex to String Converter: Decode UTF-8 Text and Bytes","description":"Convert UTF-8 text to hexadecimal bytes and decode hex back to readable strings for protocol debugging, data inspection, and encoding checks."}]}]0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","template",null,{"id":"structured-data-category-conversion-tools","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$L3"],["$L4","$L5"],"$L6"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"bYYi-ZPGnf7tmCL1WLFhj"}
